[h3][b]Bug Fixes: [/b][/h3]
1. Fixed an issue that caused accidental death if a player had only 1HP and picked the White Orb relic;
2. Fixed an issue that caused abnormal game behavior after using the Thunder Spear in some cases;
3. Fixed an issue where the elemental damage of the "Chaos Nightmare" skill was sometimes inconsistent with its description;
4. Fixed the issue in the result screen when all weapon icons would be displayed as of legendary quality after unlocking;
5. Fixed an issue where the treasure chest could no longer be opened after appearing on the floating floor tile;
6. Fixed an issue that in some cases could cause abnormal game behavior during the last boss battle on the third day.
